//
// Owning domain : Identity (chora_identity database)
// Owning team   : Team 3 (Platform)
// Topic prefix  : chora.identity.tenant_import.*
//
// The ImportJob aggregate onboards tenant(s) + their whole multi-role user
// roster from ONE Excel/GSheets-edited CSV (fleet-capable), and mass-mints
// synthetic principals for demo/load-testing. These events bracket the
// EXECUTION phase (post-confirm; the mandatory dry-run emits nothing):
//
//   started.v1   — after the operator confirms, BEFORE the first write.
//                  (The IMDA-D1 accountability record is the SEPARATE
//                  governance.audit.tenant_import_executed.v1, also
//                  emitted before writes — ADR-221 D8.)
//   completed.v1 — terminal state reached (completed |
//                  completed_with_errors | failed | cancelled) with the
//                  fully-reconciled per-outcome counts (AC-1: input rows =
//                  sum of outcomes; nothing silently dropped).
//
// Per-row grants/creates REUSE existing events (identity
// tenancy_membership.granted.v1, tenancy tenant lifecycle events) — this
// file adds NO per-row event (10k rows must not mean 10k bespoke events).
//
// EVERY event message embeds chora.common.v1.EventEnvelope as field 1.
